    {
      "scene": {
        "id": "07",
        "chapter": "Handoff",
        "narration": [
          "你可以把 Local 当作厨房明档，把 Worktree 当作后台备餐间。",
          "Handoff 就是把一道菜在前后台之间安全端进端出，底层 Git 操作全由 Codex 替你自动搞定。"
        ],
        "transition": "zoom",
        "type": "media",
        "title": "**Handoff** 就像明档与备餐间双向端菜",
        "image": "assets/codex-worktrees/kitchen-handoff.png",
        "variant": "illustration",
        "caption": "Local 是前台明档 ｜ Worktree 是后台备餐间",
        "scroll": false
      },
